From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sliva0 <sliva0mk@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diameter: Add 6 AVPs from RFC 6734
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

RFC 6734 defines these AVPs in the IETF space, which the dictionary has
no entry for at their codes:

  Key (581): Grouped, 5 members, section 3.1
  Key-Type (582): Enumerated, 3 values, section 3.1.1
  Keying-Material (583): OctetString, section 3.1.3
  Key-Lifetime (584): Unsigned32, section 3.1.4
  Key-SPI (585): Unsigned32, section 3.1.5
  Key-Name (586): OctetString, section 3.1.2

Each entry's type, enumerated values and grouped members are the
document's, from its clauses and AVP tables, and so are its M and V bits
where the document states them.

The document states no M bit for Key, Key-Type, Keying-Material,
Key-Lifetime, Key-SPI, Key-Name: RFC 6733 section 4.1 leaves it to the
application that uses an AVP, so their mandatory attribute is left at
the dictionary's default, and section 4.1.1 forbids the V bit in the
IETF space.

Generated by Seanchaí (integrations/wireshark/additions.py).
---
 resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml | 27 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 27 insertions(+)

diff --git a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
index 56a8586..fd8260f 100644
--- a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
+++ b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
@@ -2742,6 +2742,33 @@
 				<gavp name="QoS-Parameters"/>
 			</grouped>
 		</avp>
+		<avp name="Key" code="581" vendor-bit="mustnot">
+			<grouped>
+				<gavp name="Key-Type"/>
+				<gavp name="Keying-Material"/>
+				<gavp name="Key-Lifetime"/>
+				<gavp name="Key-Name"/>
+				<gavp name="Key-SPI"/>
+			</grouped>
+		</avp>
+		<avp name="Key-Type" code="582" vendor-bit="mustnot">
+			<type type-name="Enumerated"/>
+			<enum name="DSRK" code="0"/>
+			<enum name="rRK" code="1"/>
+			<enum name="rMSK" code="2"/>
+		</avp>
+		<avp name="Keying-Material" code="583" vendor-bit="mustnot">
+			<type type-name="OctetString"/>
+		</avp>
+		<avp name="Key-Lifetime" code="584" vendor-bit="mustnot">
+			<type type-name="Unsigned32"/>
+		</avp>
+		<avp name="Key-SPI" code="585" vendor-bit="mustnot">
+			<type type-name="Unsigned32"/>
+		</avp>
+		<avp name="Key-Name" code="586" vendor-bit="mustnot">
+			<type type-name="OctetString"/>
+		</avp>
 
 		<!--
 		578 QoS-Capability [RFC5777]
